	"verso":{
		"version":1,
		"drawing":[
			{"id":"d-andar-titulo","type":"text","x":40,"y":36,"width":629.2,"height":55,"strokeColor":"#1971c2","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"frameId":"l-andar","text":"🧭 Walking around the board","originalText":"🧭 Walking around the board","fontSize":44,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","lineHeight":1.25},
			{"id":"d-andar-texto","type":"text","x":40,"y":120,"width":580,"height":291.6,"strokeColor":"#343a40","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"frameId":"l-andar","text":"• Move: two fingers on the trackpad or the mouse wheel (with ⇧, sideways). Or hold space and drag. The Hand (H) also drags.\n• Zoom: pinch, ⌘ + wheel, or ⌘+ and ⌘−. ⌘0 goes back to 100%.\n• See everything: ⇧1. See only what is selected: ⇧2.\n• Go to a lesson: open the Outline, at the top right, and click it.","originalText":"• Move: two fingers on the trackpad or the mouse wheel (with ⇧, sideways). Or hold space and drag. The Hand (H) also drags.\n• Zoom: pinch, ⌘ + wheel, or ⌘+ and ⌘−. ⌘0 goes back to 100%.\n• See everything: ⇧1. See only what is selected: ⇧2.\n• Go to a lesson: open the Outline, at the top right, and click it.","fontSize":24,"fontFamily":6,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","lineHeight":1.35,"autoResize":false},
			{
				"id":"d-andar-desafio",
				"type":"rectangle",
				"x":40,
				"y":700,
				"width":580,
				"height":160,
				"strokeColor":"#f08c00",
				"backgroundColor":"#ffec99",
				"fillStyle":"solid",
				"strokeWidth":1,
				"strokeStyle":"solid",
				"roughness":1,
				"opacity":100,
