			},
			{"id":"d-desenhar-desafio-t","type":"text","x":3055,"y":750,"width":550,"height":60,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"frameId":"l-desenhar","text":"Challenge: draw a house in the dashed space: walls, roof and door.","originalText":"Challenge: draw a house in the dashed space: walls, roof and door.","fontSize":24,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"d-desenhar-desafio","lineHeight":1.25},
			{"id":"d-estilo-titulo","type":"text","x":40,"y":1136,"width":411.4,"height":55,"strokeColor":"#e03131","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"frameId":"l-estilo","text":"🎨 Color and style","originalText":"🎨 Color and style","fontSize":44,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","lineHeight":1.25},
			{"id":"d-estilo-texto","type":"text","x":40,"y":1220,"width":580,"height":259.2,"strokeColor":"#343a40","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"frameId":"l-estilo","text":"With something selected, the left panel shows Stroke, Background, Fill, stroke width, stroke style and Sloppiness, Edges and Opacity. A text gets font, size and alignment.\n• ⌘⌥C copies the style; ⌘⌥V pastes.\n• A note card also changes color, fill, edges and stroke, and Verso keeps it all in the file.","originalText":"With something selected, the left panel shows Stroke, Background, Fill, stroke width, stroke style and Sloppiness, Edges and Opacity. A text gets font, size and alignment.\n• ⌘⌥C copies the style; ⌘⌥V pastes.\n• A note card also changes color, fill, edges and stroke, and Verso keeps it all in the file.","fontSize":24,"fontFamily":6,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","lineHeight":1.35,"autoResize":false},
			{
				"id":"d-estilo-desafio",
				"type":"rectangle",
				"x":40,
				"y":1800,
				"width":580,
				"height":160,
				"strokeColor":"#f08c00",
				"backgroundColor":"#ffec99",
				"fillStyle":"solid",
				"strokeWidth":1,
				"strokeStyle":"solid",
