			{"id":"d-ligar-desafio-t","type":"text","x":1555,"y":1835,"width":550,"height":90,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"frameId":"l-ligar","text":"Challenge: connect Project Beta to Research and Findings and write “uses” on the arrow.","originalText":"Challenge: connect Project Beta to Research and Findings and write “uses” on the arrow.","fontSize":24,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"d-ligar-desafio","lineHeight":1.25},
			{"id":"d-grupos-titulo","type":"text","x":3040,"y":1136,"width":193.6,"height":55,"strokeColor":"#e8590c","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"frameId":"l-grupos","text":"📦 Groups","originalText":"📦 Groups","fontSize":44,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","lineHeight":1.25},
			{"id":"d-grupos-texto","type":"text","x":3040,"y":1220,"width":580,"height":324,"strokeColor":"#343a40","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"frameId":"l-grupos","text":"Frame is the canvas's group. The Frame tool (F, under More tools) surrounds whatever you drag around; or select and, with a right click, Wrap selection in frame. The new frame is called Frame: double-click the name to rename it. Obsidian shows the frame as a group.\n⌘G joins drawings: they move together. ⌘⇧G separates; a double click enters the group to touch a single piece.","originalText":"Frame is the canvas's group. The Frame tool (F, under More tools) surrounds whatever you drag around; or select and, with a right click, Wrap selection in frame. The new frame is called Frame: double-click the name to rename it. Obsidian shows the frame as a group.\n⌘G joins drawings: they move together. ⌘⇧G separates; a double click enters the group to touch a single piece.","fontSize":24,"fontFamily":6,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","lineHeight":1.35,"autoResize":false},
			{
				"id":"d-grupos-desafio",
				"type":"rectangle",
				"x":3040,
