			{"id":"d-grupos-desafio-t","type":"text","x":3055,"y":1835,"width":550,"height":90,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"frameId":"l-grupos","text":"Challenge: put the fruits in a frame called “Fruits” and join the robot's pieces with ⌘G.","originalText":"Challenge: put the fruits in a frame called “Fruits” and join the robot's pieces with ⌘G.","fontSize":24,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"d-grupos-desafio","lineHeight":1.25},
			{"id":"d-camadas-titulo","type":"text","x":40,"y":2236,"width":193.6,"height":55,"strokeColor":"#1971c2","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"frameId":"l-camadas","text":"🥞 Layers","originalText":"🥞 Layers","fontSize":44,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","lineHeight":1.25},
			{"id":"d-camadas-texto","type":"text","x":40,"y":2320,"width":580,"height":259.2,"strokeColor":"#343a40","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"frameId":"l-camadas","text":"What was drawn last stays on top. To change the order, use Layers in the panel, the right click, or:\n• ⌘] brings forward; ⌘[ sends backward.\n• ⌘⌥] brings to front; ⌘⌥[ sends to back.\nA drawing can sit on top of a card (good for highlighting a passage of a note) or behind it, and the order is saved in the board.","originalText":"What was drawn last stays on top. To change the order, use Layers in the panel, the right click, or:\n• ⌘] brings forward; ⌘[ sends backward.\n• ⌘⌥] brings to front; ⌘⌥[ sends to back.\nA drawing can sit on top of a card (good for highlighting a passage of a note) or behind it, and the order is saved in the board.","fontSize":24,"fontFamily":6,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","lineHeight":1.35,"autoResize":false},
			{
				"id":"d-camadas-desafio",
