			{"id":"d-camadas-desafio-t","type":"text","x":55,"y":2935,"width":550,"height":90,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"frameId":"l-camadas","text":"Challenge: put the red circle in front of everything and send the blue square to the back.","originalText":"Challenge: put the red circle in front of everything and send the blue square to the back.","fontSize":24,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"d-camadas-desafio","lineHeight":1.25},
			{"id":"d-cartoes-titulo","type":"text","x":1540,"y":2236,"width":338.8,"height":55,"strokeColor":"#6741d9","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"frameId":"l-cartoes","text":"🗒️ Verso cards","originalText":"🗒️ Verso cards","fontSize":44,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","lineHeight":1.25},
			{"id":"d-cartoes-texto","type":"text","x":1540,"y":2320,"width":580,"height":291.6,"strokeColor":"#343a40","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"frameId":"l-cartoes","text":"Insert, in the toolbar, puts things on the board: image or PDF, note or file, text, link (on a phone, in ⋯ › Board). Or drop an image here, or drag from the tree.\n• Double-click enters a card; one more click edits the note right there. Esc leaves.\n• ↗ opens the file in a tab; ⇄ swaps the card's file.\n• Background and Fill paint the card.","originalText":"Insert, in the toolbar, puts things on the board: image or PDF, note or file, text, link (on a phone, in ⋯ › Board). Or drop an image here, or drag from the tree.\n• Double-click enters a card; one more click edits the note right there. Esc leaves.\n• ↗ opens the file in a tab; ⇄ swaps the card's file.\n• Background and Fill paint the card.","fontSize":24,"fontFamily":6,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","lineHeight":1.35,"autoResize":false},
